      "html": "<p data-id=\"31c0baa71fdd532a3e7bbd7007cac80b\">The algorithm runs in constant space <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>",
